    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pollinarium is a minimalist, turn-based farming strategy game. Draw cards, place plants and appliances, and adapt to each procedurally-generated garden. Plan for synergy, adapt to each layout, and collect your harvest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your cards!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/5f37c4165feb9571811bbc209807bc04.poster.avif?t=1752949284\" aria-label=\"choosing packs and cards\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/5f37c4165feb9571811bbc209807bc04.webm?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/5f37c4165feb9571811bbc209807bc04.mp4?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cards each day. These contain a mix of plants and appliances, like onions, flowers, or berry bushes, and supportive tools like bee hotels, ponds, or rainwater tanks. Different card types unlock different strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place your plants and appliances strategically!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/86fae0d490f363db215562e1dd623c3c.poster.avif?t=1752949284\" aria-label=\"placing plants\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/86fae0d490f363db215562e1dd623c3c.webm?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/86fae0d490f363db215562e1dd623c3c.mp4?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every plant has distinct traits: growth speed, regrowth time, harvest value, and how it interacts with neighbors. Some thrive with friends nearby, others... not so much. Appliances give area-wide bonuses, helping boost your yield if placed wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your garden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/a2f8c036419bd8580e8380072d783768.poster.avif?t=1752949284\" aria-label=\"plants growing\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/a2f8c036419bd8580e8380072d783768.webm?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/a2f8c036419bd8580e8380072d783768.mp4?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the day and watch plants evolve through multiple growth stages. Regrowth cycles, timing, and synergy effects all come into play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect your harvest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/7c89a65e111fd511440fd34e4682cf15.poster.avif?t=1752949284\" aria-label=\"collecting harvest\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/7c89a65e111fd511440fd34e4682cf15.webm?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/7c89a65e111fd511440fd34e4682cf15.mp4?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush, no watering, just strategic planting and harvesting to reach the necessary  points within the given days. Experiment freely to unlock strategic combinations and maximize your gardens\u2019 harvest!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pollinarium is a minimalist, turn-based farming strategy game. Draw cards, place plants and appliances, and adapt to each procedurally-generated garden. Plan for synergy, adapt to each layout, and collect your harvest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your cards!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/5f37c4165feb9571811bbc209807bc04.poster.avif?t=1752949284\" aria-label=\"choosing packs and cards\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/5f37c4165feb9571811bbc209807bc04.webm?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/5f37c4165feb9571811bbc209807bc04.mp4?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cards each day. These contain a mix of plants and appliances, like onions, flowers, or berry bushes, and supportive tools like bee hotels, ponds, or rainwater tanks. Different card types unlock different strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place your plants and appliances strategically!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/86fae0d490f363db215562e1dd623c3c.poster.avif?t=1752949284\" aria-label=\"placing plants\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/86fae0d490f363db215562e1dd623c3c.webm?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/86fae0d490f363db215562e1dd623c3c.mp4?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every plant has distinct traits: growth speed, regrowth time, harvest value, and how it interacts with neighbors. Some thrive with friends nearby, others... not so much. Appliances give area-wide bonuses, helping boost your yield if placed wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your garden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/a2f8c036419bd8580e8380072d783768.poster.avif?t=1752949284\" aria-label=\"plants growing\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/a2f8c036419bd8580e8380072d783768.webm?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/a2f8c036419bd8580e8380072d783768.mp4?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the day and watch plants evolve through multiple growth stages. Regrowth cycles, timing, and synergy effects all come into play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect your harvest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/7c89a65e111fd511440fd34e4682cf15.poster.avif?t=1752949284\" aria-label=\"collecting harvest\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/7c89a65e111fd511440fd34e4682cf15.webm?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833630/extras/7c89a65e111fd511440fd34e4682cf15.mp4?t=1752949284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush, no watering, just strategic planting and harvesting to reach the necessary  points within the given days. Experiment freely to unlock strategic combinations and maximize your gardens\u2019 harvest!</p>",
